        },
        {
          "text": "Igo, Esau akarega Yakobho gikugira ya amaiyabhiriö gaara isawaabho aamöhaayë. Esau agaitegeerra iga, “Hano ichinsikö cha öbhoohu bhu uruku rö taata chirisira, nëho ndiita Yakobho.”",
